menu "tiny-paper imgdec"

config IMGDEC_PROGRESSIVE
    bool "Progressive JPEG decoding (docs/spec/assets.md \"JPEG\")"
    default y
    help
        Progressive JPEGs (Nextcloud's previews): with PSRAM (trmnl_x, xteink_x4pro) through a coefficient store of
        the whole image (up to 4 MiB, plugin_host tph_image.c); on the ESP32-C3 boards in bands of rows from the
        file on flash within the 24 KiB decoder budget (assets.md "JPEG" Progressive bands). Off: the define
        IMGDEC_NO_PROGRESSIVE, progressive JPEGs refused (IMGDEC_E_PROGRESSIVE, "progressive JPEG").

endmenu
